  "scope": "The Profile-vocabulary test transitions of OME-1138 Stage E, E5c, per the owner-approved test map: suites wholly about a deleted module or tool become retirement docstrings naming their successors; surviving suites and the shared harnesses stop seeding or reading Profile documents and the index, keeping every Connection, marker, blob, response and cache assertion; tests whose only claim was about a Profile document, a stored default, the index or a retired tool are deleted with a retirement line in their module docstring; the shared test vocabulary goes neutral (SeedState, RealAppHarness, seed_blob/seed_credential, credential_state); the import, vocabulary, conflict-arm and auth-mode guards move to the modules' absence.",
  "reason": "Stage E history cleanup, E5c: the gateway deletes profile_index, profile_models, the offline backfill and the history purge, credential_names.profile_id_for, and the Profile argument of auth_type_of. Runtime has been Connection-only since E4a/E4b and the E5b purge has removed the index rows from every environment, so no test may import those modules and a seeded document is inert.",
